      "raw": "<p>While impressive, the spirits of Spirit Island possess rather unwieldy names. &nbsp;So the time has come to give them all nicknames!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here are my proposals. &nbsp;Some are terrible, some are obscure (or not) references, and some are unimaginative, but here they are:</p><p><strong>Lightning&#39;s Swift Strike:</strong> Sparky<br /><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">River Surges in Sunlight: </strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Splashy</span><br /><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Vital Strength of the Earth:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> Rocky&nbsp;</span><br /><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Shadows Flicker Like Flames:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> Plato</span><br /><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Ocean&#39;s Hungry Grasp:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> Ed</span><br /><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">A Spread of Rampant Green: </strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Audrey II</span><br /><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Bringer of Dreams and Nightmares: </strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Boo</span><br /><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Thunderspeaker:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> Bang</span><br /><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Serpent Slumbering Beneath the Island:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> The Bi-Colored-Python-Rock-Snake</span><br /><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Heart of the Wildfire:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> Bouncy&nbsp;</span><br /><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Sharp Fangs Behind the Leaves:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> Mr. Chomps&nbsp;</span><br /><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Keeper of the Forbidden Wilds:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> Maro</span><br /><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Volcano Looms on High: </strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Sir Not-Appearing-in-this-Game</span></p>",
